    name: "Sam Medina",
    role: "VP, Human Resources",
    company: "",
    initial: "S",
  },
  {
    quote: "I began my work with Dr. Jill with the expectation of becoming a more effective leader. What I found is that her focus on Behavioral Intelligence is different and has had a significant impact on me. It indeed has helped increase my leadership effectiveness. At the same time, focusing on my own behaviors first has helped me become a better person — husband, father and friend. I was not expecting this and as a result am even more committed to perfecting the practice.",
