    name: "Jill Peck",
    role: "President",
    company: "HSP Marketing Firm",
    initial: "J",
    featured: true,
  },
  {
    quote: "What could have been an extremely difficult year for me turned into a self-empowering, life lesson opportunity. I certainly had plenty of opportunity to \"live\" the BioCode system. I feel confident in myself, my leadership and in my ability to navigate life without getting thrown off track.",
